; cumulative regression: every instruction class interacting
LIL R7, 0xF0
LIH R7, 0x05
LIL R0, 0x00
LIH R0, 0x04
LIL R1, 6
LIL R2, 0
loop: BZ R1, done
ADD R2, R2, R1
STB R2, 0(R0)
ADDI R0, 1
PUSH R2
ADDI R1, -1
JMP loop
done: POP R3
LDB R4, -1(R0)
SHL R4, 2
SHR R4, 1
XOR R5, R3, R4
NOT R5, R5
SLT R6, R5, R3
CALL f
HLT
f: MOV R3, R6
RET
